# Owning plan 13-04 (EV-07): the four D-09-06 mechanisms whose only proof is an in-step case of the
# gate step runner-selftest (D-12). One case name per line; the step runs exactly these and fails on
# a name it does not run (runner-selftest-missing), so a registry row can never point at a renamed or
# deleted case. The other six mechanisms of the D-09-06 list are registered as `control` rows,
# because a control directory already proves them.
st-toy-drift
st-deviation-unused
st-pass-line
st-memmap-generator-missing
